    "https://www.hr.upenn.edu/PennHR/careers-at-penn": {
      "title": "Find opportunities that match your goals",
      "description": "Careers at Penn Human Resources Skip to Main Content About HR Managers Workplace Issues Policies Retirees Workday Contact Search Penn Human Resources Submit Search Careers at Penn How to Apply Penn's Schools and Centers Opportunities with Penn Service Providers Hiring and Recruitment Career Development Career Forward Salary Offers LCA Notices Benefits & Compensation Compensation Health, Life, and FSA Tuition Saving for Retirement Requesting a Leave of Absence Time Off, Disability, & Leave Family Support Wellness and Counseling Open Enrollment Retiree Benefits Telemedicine Postdoctoral Researchers and Fellows Penn Benefit Extras Working Spouse Contribution Penn Community People University Resources Transportation Deals & Discounts Penn & Philadelphia Awards and Appreciation Learn & Grow Orientation and Onboarding Trainings, Courses, and Webinars Tuition Benefit Leadership Development Tools and Resources Career Development Support Consulting & Custom Training Request Competency Library Wellness & Work-Life Penn Healthy You Counseling and Referrals (EAP) Caring for Your Family and Self Legal and Financial Resources (EAP) Upcoming Events and Workshops Employment Verification Services Starting and Growing Your Family MindWell at Penn Flexible, Hybrid, and Remote Work Search Jobs Find opportunities that match your goals at any point in a career. How to Apply Penn's Schools and Centers Opportunities with Penn Service Providers Hiring and Recruitment Career Development Career Forward Salary Offers LCA Notices Penn HR Careers at Penn Careers at Penn America's Best Large Employers For three years in a row, Forbes has named Penn as one of America's Best Large Employers . Search Penn Jobs External Staff Applicants Internal Staff Applicants Faculty Applicants Penn is now posting staff jobs as hybrid eligible, remote eligible, and remote required. If a position is eligible, one of the terms below will appear in the Additional Job Description field. Hybrid Eligible –\n    These positions are eligible for a hybrid work schedule with a work week divided between working onsite and working remotely. Remote Eligible - These positions are eligible for a fully remote schedule with all work performed remotely. Remote Required - These positions are fully remote with all work performed remotely. A Great Place to Work Penn's innovative schools, centers, and divisions offer a vast array of positions in a broad range of fields. Penn is the largest private employer in Philadelphia. Here you can find new opportunities as your career develops—from your first job out\n    of school to your first leadership role, and all points in between. You can discover new work settings as your goals evolve, and even change professions. We’re famous for research and education, but did you know Penn also offers positions in areas such as financial management, hospitality, transportation, real estate development, investments, public safety, fundraising, marketing, communications,\n    and information technology (IT)? Penn is a leading employer in key fields. We are regularly ranked as one of the best places to work in IT, and our Office of Development and Alumni Relations is one of the premier organizations in the industry. If you have a passion for excellence in education, research, or service to the community, Penn is the right choice for any point in your professional journey. Quick Links Benefits & Pay Competitive Benefits Snapshot Tuition Benefits Information for Hiring Managers Jobs with Penn Service Providers Penn Career Paths Mission Community Mobility Prospective Faculty Learn more about Penn faculty appointments and resources at faculty.upenn.edu . A Top Employer #1 largest private employer in Philadelphia $938 million in research awards 12 graduate and professional schools 142 Research Centers and Institutes Learn More: Penn & Philly ; Penn Research ; Schools at Penn ; Centers & Institutes An Award-Winning Workplace Penn has received dozens of awards on all facets of its work environment, including: America’s Best Large Employers Seal of Distinction Opportunity America’s Best Large Employers of 2023 Forbes and Statista selected the America’s Best Large Employers 2023 through an independent survey applied to a sample of more than 60,000 American employees working for companies with more than 1,000 employees in the United States. Learn More: Forbes 2016 and 2017 WorldatWork Seal of Distinction Awards Penn Human Resource Department Learn More: Seal of Distinction Inaugural Recipient of the Urban League of Philadelphia Vision Award Workforce Opportunities Learn More: Vision Award One University, Many Fields Administrative Professionals Researchers Technology Development and Alumni Relations Student Affairs And More Penn Human Resources Division of Human Resources 600 Franklin Building 3451 Walnut Street Philadelphia , PA 19104-6205 News Calendar HR Staff Forms Subscribe Penn Home U@Penn Jobs@Penn Copyright © 2026 The University of Pennsylvania Copyright Equal Opportunity Employer Legal Notices Clery Act Workplace Posters Report Accessibility Issues and Get Help"
    },
